{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2020-11", "window": 3, "start_date": 1605484800, "end_date": 1606089599, "month_true_total": 297, "quota": 6, "returned": 6, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 21:54:20 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "79685318", "author": {"steamid": "76561198094019243", "personaname": "SevenEven", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/YAY7Even/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 3519, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1746, "last_played": 1621023470, "avatar": "e8ef2b11eee5e2b7b13c3a82cbbbb5e4efdb454a"}, "language": "english", "review": "this game is underrated\n\nJust finished my first play through. I smashed through the story and the side missions that had to do with people i liked and it was a good time. If you focus on the story it helps keep the pacing and intensity high and i think that will help a lot of people enjoy it.\n\nthey fixed the animations and i think people were to harsh on the story and your crew mates because you can find compelling side stories. decide what kind of person you want to be before hand or really early on and stick with it to create your own Ryder\n\nI am excited to finish some more quests with my first Ryder and i will prob do another one and make tottaly different decisions.", "timestamp_created": 1606089153, "timestamp_updated": 1606089153, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "79668057", "author": {"steamid": "76561199075884406", "personaname": "seba", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/cr11nie/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 63, "playtime_last